WEBVTT

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:30.370
Naročito je to bitno

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:31.740
za parnice.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:34.100
Jer sve ono zbog čega ljudi
mogu da tuže,

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:36.740
uspostavlja granice
za slobodu svih ostalih.

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:39.720
Ako neko tuži jer:
"Dete je palo sa

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:41.740
klackalice",
nije bitan ishod parnice,

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:43.730
jer će sve klackalice biti uklonjene.

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:45.740
Jer niko ne želi
da rizikuje takvu parnicu.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:48.390
To se i desilo.
Nema klackalica, pentralica

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.470
vrteški, konopaca za penjanje,

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.730
svega onoga što zanima
starije od 4 godine,

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.250
te nema rizika koji oni povlače.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.260
Dakle, kako da ponovo sve izgradimo?

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:59.770
Život je previše složen...

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.740
(Aplauz)